{
  "spoken_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_cinder_intro_01",
      "string_id": "16491531625022283032",
      "speaker": "Cinder",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Patch says you can remove a machine without turning the whole block into a fireworks display.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_cinder_intro_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_E4DDB0A31792DD18",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_E4DDB0A31792DD18"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_common_ground_line",
      "string_id": "6219720576047696843",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Cinder",
      "text": "Common Ground. Activists, gang, support group?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_v_choice_common_ground_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_5650E2E91182CBCB",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_5650E2E91182CBCB"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_cinder_rsp_common_ground_01",
      "string_id": "4090841471713655899",
      "speaker": "Cinder",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Neighbors with tools. We pull subscription locks off water pumps, print parts corps stopped selling, keep old implants alive. If that sounds like a gang, blame the city.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_cinder_rsp_common_ground_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 10960,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_38C596A4F1EDBC5B",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_38C596A4F1EDBC5B"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_hate_tech_line",
      "string_id": "15567476645485822455",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Cinder",
      "text": "So what, you want everyone back to candles and hand-cranks?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_v_choice_hate_tech_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_D80AC9876F5F41F7",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_D80AC9876F5F41F7"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_cinder_rsp_hate_tech_01",
      "string_id": "1727045619934302475",
      "speaker": "Cinder",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I want a hand-crank when the vendor kills the cloud. Technology isn't the problem. Obedience disguised as convenience is.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_cinder_rsp_hate_tech_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8160,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_17F7B2D74F14110B",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_17F7B2D74F14110B"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_job_line",
      "string_id": "7689667958298558305",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Cinder",
      "text": "Show me the machine.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_v_choice_job_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2000,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_6AB730443716BF61",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_6AB730443716BF61"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_cinder_rsp_job_01",
      "string_id": "6487409154016555721",
      "speaker": "Cinder",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Kabuki relay. Officially dead. Actually profiles tenants for a redevelopment shell. Scan it first. I want proof before you cut power.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_cinder_rsp_job_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 9840,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_5A07E840F9C632C9",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_5A07E840F9C632C9"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_why_me_line",
      "string_id": "12147258880178262037",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Cinder",
      "text": "Your people fix machines. Why hire me to break one?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_v_choice_why_me_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3520,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_A893BB97B3BC1015",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_A893BB97B3BC1015"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_cinder_rsp_why_me_01",
      "string_id": "227216774058103199",
      "speaker": "Cinder",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Because the owners hired people who break bones. My crew are technicians, not martyrs.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_cinder_rsp_why_me_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6640,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_03273C73C0BE519F",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_03273C73C0BE519F"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_accept_line",
      "string_id": "15961195024846148534",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Cinder",
      "text": "I'll inspect the relay. If it's what you say, it's gone.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_v_choice_accept_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_DD818E4F1EAFD3B6",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_DD818E4F1EAFD3B6"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_cinder_rsp_accept_01",
      "string_id": "7241948128173650420",
      "speaker": "Cinder",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "If it's what I say. Evidence first, conviction second.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq002\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq002_01_cinder_rsp_accept_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_64809173FD9871F4",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "f_64809173FD9871F4"
    }
  ],
  "choice_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_common_ground_short",
      "string_id": "6405700313819703929",
      "text": "Who are Common Ground?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_hate_tech_short",
      "string_id": "14946375915586625349",
      "text": "You hate tech?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_job_short",
      "string_id": "3489697437809755723",
      "text": "What needs removing?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_why_me_short",
      "string_id": "3227964876812912943",
      "text": "Why me?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq002_01_v_choice_accept_short",
      "string_id": "767245177778904318",
      "text": "I'll check it."
    }
  ],
